PN,36301
SC,0001
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F363A1786103287
OL,3,C'Whistleblowing' nurse warns lives are
OL,4,Cbeing lost due to NMC delays
OL,6,FWhen Ishbel Straker decided to do what
OL,7,Fshe believed was whistleblow on a
OL,8,Fhealthcare provider, she thought she'd
OL,9,Fbe thanked and protected. Instead, she
OL,10,Fsays her career and reputation have
OL,11,Fbeen destroyed.
OL,13,FThe mental health nurse from
OL,14,FLiverpool, who runs her own
OL,15,Fconsultancy business, had been brought
OL,16,Fin to support staff at an NHS Trust
OL,17,Ffollowing a string of suicides.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/22
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,364,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36302
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F363A1786103287
OL,3,C'Whistleblowing' nurse warns lives are
OL,4,Cbeing lost due to NMC delays
OL,6,FBut she says she was so alarmed about
OL,7,Fhow staff were being safeguarded and
OL,8,Fthe practices of that healthcare
OL,9,Fprovider that she raised the alarm.
OL,11,F"I didn't realise how hard that was
OL,12,Fgoing to be because whistleblowing as
OL,13,Fan external provider into an
OL,14,Forganisation is not something that
OL,15,Fpeople generally do, and the
OL,16,Fstructures aren't set up for that.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/22
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,364,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36303
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F363A1786103287
OL,3,C'Whistleblowing' nurse warns lives are
OL,4,Cbeing lost due to NMC delays
OL,6,F"They're set up for that internal
OL,7,Fwhistleblowing, as are the protections
OL,8,Ffor that. But I naively thought
OL,9,Fjustice is going to prevail. I've got
OL,10,Feverything documented."
OL,12,FWithin a month, that healthcare
OL,13,Fprovider had issued its own complaint
OL,14,Fagainst Ishbel to the nursing
OL,15,Fregulator, the Nursing and Midwifery
OL,16,FCouncil (NMC). They insist that was
OL,17,Fnot in retaliation.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/22
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,364,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36304
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F363A1786103287
OL,3,C'Whistleblowing' nurse warns lives are
OL,4,Cbeing lost due to NMC delays
OL,6,FIshbel was then the subject of two
OL,7,Ffurther unrelated complaints from a
OL,8,Fdisgruntled patient and an ex-
OL,9,Femployee, which resulted in her being
OL,10,Fsuspended.
OL,12,FAlmost six years on from that first
OL,13,Fcomplaint, Ishbel is still waiting for
OL,14,Fthe NMC to hear her cases. The target
OL,15,Fis supposed to be 15 months.
OL,17,FIshbel said it is like living in limbo.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/22
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,364,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36305
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F363A1786103287
OL,3,C'Whistleblowing' nurse warns lives are
OL,4,Cbeing lost due to NMC delays
OL,6,F"It's horrendous, absolutely
OL,7,Fhorrendous, because there feels like
OL,8,Fthere's no end. That's the problem.
OL,9,FAnd it feels like it's completely
OL,10,Fhopeless."
OL,12,FThese delays to fitness to Practice
OL,13,Fhearings aren't unusual. Figures from
OL,14,Fthe NMC themselves show more than a
OL,15,Fquarter of people facing a fitness to
OL,16,Fpractice hearing are waiting longer
OL,17,Fthan the recommended 15 months.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/22
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,364,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36306
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F363A1786103287
OL,3,C'Whistleblowing' nurse warns lives are
OL,4,Cbeing lost due to NMC delays
OL,6,FSince 2018, it's thought at least 18
OL,7,Fhealthcare workers have taken their
OL,8,Fown lives whilst waiting for their
OL,9,Fcases to be heard.
OL,11,FNone of those deaths has been
OL,12,Fofficially linked to the NMC
OL,13,Fprocesses, but one support group said
OL,14,Fthese delays are causing unnecessary
OL,15,Fharm.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G6/22
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,364,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36307
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F363A1786103287
OL,3,C'Whistleblowing' nurse warns lives are
OL,4,Cbeing lost due to NMC delays
OL,6,FCathryn Watters from NMC Watch said
OL,7,F"It's horrendous. One death is just
OL,8,Fabsolutely tragic. But it's about
OL,9,Ftrying to understand why that has
OL,10,Fhappened, and yes, there may well be
OL,11,Fpre-existing issues going on, but for
OL,12,Feverybody in that process to
OL,13,Frecognise: what could we have done
OL,14,Fbetter to try and reduce this risk as
OL,15,Fmuch as possible?
OL,17,F"That's what I feel is really lacking."
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G7/22
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,364,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36308
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F363A1786103287
OL,3,C'Whistleblowing' nurse warns lives are
OL,4,Cbeing lost due to NMC delays
OL,6,FIshbel says the reputational damage,
OL,7,Ffinancial burden, and emotional toll
OL,8,Fof these time delays is huge for those
OL,9,Finvolved. She has warned it is only a
OL,10,Fmatter of time before another life is
OL,11,Flost.
OL,13,F"I see on a daily basis people talking
OL,14,Fabout the fact that they want to end
OL,15,Ftheir lives because of these
OL,16,Fprocesses. That is the absolute
OL,17,Freality.
OL,19,F"It's humiliating and you're exposing
OL,20,Fyourself.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G8/22
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,364,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36309
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F363A1786103287
OL,3,C'Whistleblowing' nurse warns lives are
OL,4,Cbeing lost due to NMC delays
OL,6,F"It's so humiliating that nurses don't
OL,7,Ftell their partners. But you're also
OL,8,Fconstantly told and gaslit that it's
OL,9,Fyou, you're the problem."
OL,11,FAn independent review of the NMC in
OL,12,F2024 identified a dangerously toxic
OL,13,Fculture in which bullying, racism, and
OL,14,Fburnout were putting nurses and the
OL,15,Fpublic at risk.
OL,17,FNow, the NMC say they've since made
OL,18,Fsubstantial improvements, but Ishbel
OL,19,Fbelieves that racism could be an issue
OL,20,Fin her case.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G9/22
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,364,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36310
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F363A1786103287
OL,3,C'Whistleblowing' nurse warns lives are
OL,4,Cbeing lost due to NMC delays
OL,6,F"As a person that is from an ethnic
OL,7,Fminority`black and ethnic
OL,8,Fminorities`you are more likely to go
OL,9,Fthrough a fitness to practice process.
OL,11,F"You are more likely to be suspended;
OL,12,Fthree times more likely.
OL,14,F"It just put a fire in me of: there's
OL,15,Fan injustice happening here and I need
OL,16,Fto do something about it."
OL,18,FIshbel has now started her own
OL,19,Fcampaign group, the Regulatory Justice
OL,20,FFoundation.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G10/22
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,364,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36311
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F363A1786103287
OL,3,C'Whistleblowing' nurse warns lives are
OL,4,Cbeing lost due to NMC delays
OL,6,FShe's calling for an amendment to the
OL,7,FHillsborough Law to bring in an Office
OL,8,Fof the Whistleblower, and a public
OL,9,Finquiry into the Fitness to Practice
OL,10,F(FtP) process.
OL,12,FClare Fletcher, Partner at Broudie
OL,13,FJackson Canter legal firm said, "The
OL,14,FNMC have not been meeting the fitness
OL,15,Fto practice standard for some
OL,16,Fconsiderable years.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G11/22
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,364,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36312
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F363A1786103287
OL,3,C'Whistleblowing' nurse warns lives are
OL,4,Cbeing lost due to NMC delays
OL,6,F"My concern is who does something
OL,7,Fabout that? There's a lot to answer
OL,8,Ffor, and I think at the moment the
OL,9,Fonly way to get these answers and to
OL,10,Freally put the NMC under proper
OL,11,Fscrutiny is via a public inquiry."
OL,13,FOn Monday 20 July, Justice for Nurses,
OL,14,Flaunched a campaign backed by cross-
OL,15,Fparty MPs, calling for a Westminster
OL,16,FHall debate and a select committee
OL,17,Finquiry into the Nursing and Midwifery
OL,18,FCouncil.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G12/22
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,364,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36313
SC,0013
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F363A1786103287
OL,3,C'Whistleblowing' nurse warns lives are
OL,4,Cbeing lost due to NMC delays
OL,6,FIt came after the Professional
OL,7,FStandards Authority (PSA), published
OL,8,Fits annual review of the Nursing and
OL,9,FMidwifery Council's performance for
OL,10,F2024-2025.
OL,12,FThe regulator found the NMC met only 9
OL,13,Fout of its 18 Standards of Good
OL,14,FRegulation, including falling short in
OL,15,Fsome aspects of Fitness to Practice.
OL,17,FIshbel Straker, Founder, Justice for
OL,18,FNurses, said "Over a thousand nurses
OL,19,Fhave signed our petition and 160 have
OL,20,Fshared their stories in under two
OL,21,Fweeks.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G13/22
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,364,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36314
SC,0014
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F363A1786103287
OL,3,C'Whistleblowing' nurse warns lives are
OL,4,Cbeing lost due to NMC delays
OL,6,F"These are not statistics. These are
OL,7,Fnurses who have given their lives to
OL,8,Fcaring for others and who have been
OL,9,Fbroken by a system that claims to
OL,10,Fprotect the public while destroying
OL,11,Fthe professionals who serve it.
OL,13,FThe NMC has not met its own fitness to
OL,14,Fpractise standard since 2018/19.
OL,15,FParliament must now ask: who is
OL,16,Fregulating the regulator?"
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G14/22
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,364,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36315
SC,0015
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F363A1786103287
OL,3,C'Whistleblowing' nurse warns lives are
OL,4,Cbeing lost due to NMC delays
OL,6,FAn NMC spokesperson said: "We can
OL,7,Fconfirm that concerns have been raised
OL,8,Fwith us about Ms Straker's fitness to
OL,9,Fpractise. To ensure a fair process, it
OL,10,Fwouldn't be appropriate for us to say
OL,11,Fmore at this stage, but we have a duty
OL,12,Fto investigate concerns that are
OL,13,Fraised with us about professionals on
OL,14,Fthe register.
OL,26,@nD@[OU
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G15/22
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,364,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36316
SC,0016
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F363A1786103287
OL,3,C'Whistleblowing' nurse warns lives are
OL,4,Cbeing lost due to NMC delays
OL,6,F"We recognise that being involved in
OL,7,Four Fitness to Practise processes can
OL,8,Fbe distressing, and we're striving to
OL,9,Fmake our processes faster, fairer and
OL,10,Fmore compassionate. On average we're
OL,11,Fnow resolving cases at the fastest
OL,12,Frate for more than five years ` but
OL,13,Frecognise that we need to improve much
OL,14,Ffurther."
OL,16,FThe NMC noted that since 2018, there
OL,17,Fhave been 18 registrant deaths by
OL,18,Fsuicide in the Fitness to Practise
OL,19,FProcess.
OL,26,@nD@AOUvD@IO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G16/22
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,364,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36317
SC,0017
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F363A1786103287
OL,3,C'Whistleblowing' nurse warns lives are
OL,4,Cbeing lost due to NMC delays
OL,6,FBut the nursing regulator told ITV
OL,7,FNews that it is important to reflect
OL,8,Fthat the work they do brings them into
OL,9,Fcontact with people who are often
OL,10,Fexperiencing difficulties or are in
OL,11,Fvulnerable circumstances.
OL,13,F"When we report that somebody has died
OL,14,Fwhile our regulatory processes are
OL,15,Fongoing, we do not mean to say that
OL,16,Fthey died because of our processes.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G17/22
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,364,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36318
SC,0018
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F363A1786103287
OL,3,C'Whistleblowing' nurse warns lives are
OL,4,Cbeing lost due to NMC delays
OL,6,F"Only a coroner can make that
OL,7,Fdetermination, and to date, we have
OL,8,Fnot received a formal instruction from
OL,9,Fa coroner related to a registrant's
OL,10,Fdeath.
OL,12,F"In September 2024, we established a
OL,13,Fcentral Safeguarding Hub, which has
OL,14,Freviewed more than 7,000 Fitness to
OL,15,FPractise (FtP) referrals through a
OL,16,Fsafeguarding lens over the past 18
OL,17,Fmonths.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G18/22
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,364,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36319
SC,0019
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F363A1786103287
OL,3,C'Whistleblowing' nurse warns lives are
OL,4,Cbeing lost due to NMC delays
OL,6,F"The Hub ensures that every referral
OL,7,F(new concern raised with the regulator
OL,8,Fabout a registrant) is assessed by a
OL,9,Fprofessional with safeguarding
OL,10,Fexpertise.
OL,12,F"This means that potential
OL,13,Fsafeguarding or serious wellbeing
OL,14,Frisks are identified immediately, and
OL,15,Fthe right support can be put in place
OL,16,Fwhere needed to protect people from
OL,17,Fharm.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G19/22
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,364,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36320
SC,0020
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F363A1786103287
OL,3,C'Whistleblowing' nurse warns lives are
OL,4,Cbeing lost due to NMC delays
OL,6,F"To further strengthen its approach,
OL,7,Fwe have also reviewed and updated our
OL,8,FSafeguarding Policy. The policy sets
OL,9,Fout how the NMC responds when it comes
OL,10,Finto contact with people who are at
OL,11,Frisk of harm, abuse or neglect.
OL,13,F"This includes the requirement for all
OL,14,FNMC staff to complete safeguarding
OL,15,Ftraining, and provides details of an
OL,16,Femergency helpline which any member of
OL,17,Fthe staff team can use for immediate
OL,18,Fsafeguarding advice."
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G20/22
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,364,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36321
SC,0021
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F363A1786103287
OL,3,C'Whistleblowing' nurse warns lives are
OL,4,Cbeing lost due to NMC delays
OL,6,FITV News has chosen not to name the
OL,7,Fhealthcare provider or the NHS Trust
OL,8,Finvolved in this story.
OL,10,FNeither wanted to comment publicly
OL,11,Fahead of the NMC hearing.
OL,13,FHowever, the healthcare provider did
OL,14,Fpoint out that the suicides linked to
OL,15,Fthe NHS Trust took place before that
OL,16,Fprovider was awarded the contract with
OL,17,Fthe Trust.
